cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenCorpFilings in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenCorpFilings: public company filings worldwide, one Python API"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that discovers public-company filings at the regulators that
  hold them (SEC EDGAR, UK Companies House, Japan's EDINET, France's AMF/DILA
  service and the ESEF index) and retrieves the original documents with their
  source identifiers, dates and URLs.
authors:
  - name: SourceState
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sourcestate-io/opencorpfilings"
keywords:
  - corporate filings
  - annual reports
  - SEC EDGAR
  - EDINET
  - Companies House
  - ESEF
  - XBRL
  - provenance
